    "notASlugMigrationWorklist": "This file is NOT authority to edit any product's registered `slug`. Per CLAUDE.md §'slug, display name, and the federated serve path are THREE INDEPENDENT questions', slug is free at registration and immutable after. If a live registry slug genuinely differs from an entry below, FIX THIS FILE to match the registry — never the other way around. This list exists only to notice disappearance, not to prescribe naming.",
    "maintainedBy": "owner (izzywdev) — add an entry when a new product joins the family, remove one when a product is formally retired, correct the slug if a `confidence` below turns out wrong.",
    "lastReviewed": "2026-09-08",
